==Trivia==

*Currently, he is the only EVA Angel to not have a cat counterpart.
*This is currently the tallest enemy in the game.
*Him and [[Elder Flame Doron]] are tied for being the enemy with the highest number of [[Special Abilities]] at 10.
*Prior to [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] of the [[The Battle Cats|English Version]], this enemy was named "Awakened Eva Unit-13".

